{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>The rich</b>, <b>sows</b>, <b>good</b> — [zayin–tet] three joined forms. Over the poor who have nothing, he rules them by force, and the one who borrows from him, he compels him to be his slave."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:24:07.509798936Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}